@AITestHub_HostAddress = http://localhost:5098

### Health check
GET {{AITestHub_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### List projects
GET {{AITestHub_HostAddress}}/api/projects
Accept: application/json

### Create a project
POST {{AITestHub_HostAddress}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Demo Project",
  "description": "Public API demo"
}

### Generate executable AI test cases (NOT persisted; review then call /save-api)
POST {{AITestHub_HostAddress}}/api/aitestcases/generate-api
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": 1,
  "baseUrl": "https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com",
  "endpoint": "/posts",
  "httpMethod": "POST",
  "requirement": "Creating a post with a valid title and body returns 201 with the created post. Missing title returns 400.",
  "count": 5
}

### Execute a saved test case
POST {{AITestHub_HostAddress}}/api/testcases/1/execute

### Execution history of a test case
GET {{AITestHub_HostAddress}}/api/testcases/1/executions
Accept: application/json

### Global dashboard summary
GET {{AITestHub_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/summary
Accept: application/json
